<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait private deposits edge down in April mo/mo.</title>
<headline>Kuwait private deposits edge down in April mo/mo.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private sector deposits with banks in Kuwait fell slightly to 7.171 billion dinars at the end of April from 7.173 billion at the end of March, Central Bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The deposits stood at 6.951 billion in April 1996.</p>
<p>			   Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				 April '97  March '97  April '96</p>
<p>Dinar deposits		5,795.8    5,806.7    5,593.2</p>
<p>Foreign currency deposits 1,375.0    1,366.5    1,357.5</p>
<p>($1 = 0.302 dinar)</p>
</text>
